Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.34,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.70,0:00:06.89,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,300,450,3900,4240)\pos(640,426.667)}Episode 69 \N\N\N\N\N\NWinning Over Jiāng Wéi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.56,0:00:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a great fortune that Sir Administrator is willing to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.34,0:00:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.34,0:00:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.66,0:00:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It is said you are great friends with Administrator Yang Ling of Nan'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.23,0:00:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.18,0:00:37.44,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(278,426)}Cuī Liàng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.13,0:00:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I do have a private relationship with Yang Ling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:45.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(334,504)}Zhūgě Liàng\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.34,0:00:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If Sir Administrator were to visit Nan'an and persuade Yang Ling to surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.66,0:00:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and capture Xiahou Mao, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.50,0:00:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I am willing to serve the Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.74,0:01:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Administrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.52,0:01:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,However, you, Sir Chancellor, need to withdraw the siege temporarily,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.15,0:01:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,so that I may enter the city to persuade him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.74,0:01:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish, Administrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.34,0:01:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I will order the besieging troops to retreat twenty {\i1}li.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.14,0:01:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.18,0:01:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who is below the walls?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.59,0:01:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Cui Liang, the Administrator of Anding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.02,0:01:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I have important matters to discuss with Administrator Yang.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.46,0:01:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower the drawbridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.26,0:01:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lower the drawbridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.50,0:01:51.44,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(308,544)}Yáng Líng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.84,0:01:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we can use this chance to eliminate Zhuge Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.90,0:01:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:54.11,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(800,364)}Xiàhóu Mào\NStyled: Zǐxiū
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let Administrator Cui return, meet Zhuge Liang,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.94,0:01:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,tell him that I surrender, \Nand let Zhuge Liang bring his troops here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.80,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,When he enters the city, we ambush and kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.06,0:02:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, this plan is excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.80,0:02:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,May Administrator Cui journey back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.30,0:02:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.90,0:02:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be splendid if Administrator Yang \Nwere willing to surrender the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.44,0:02:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you capture Xiahou Mao?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.30,0:02:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiahou Mao is heavily guarded,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.51,0:02:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and Administrator Yang's subordinates lack brave warriors, so we did not dare to act rashly!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.55,0:02:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an easy matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.26,0:02:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals Zhang Bao and Guan Xing will lead a hundred soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.54,0:02:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They will disguise as Anding troops and enter the city with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.66,0:02:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they will set an ambush near Xiahou Mao's mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.97,0:02:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,At midnight, I will open the gates and surrender the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.66,0:02:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope the Chancellor will lead the troops personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.96,0:03:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,With our coordination, we can succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish, Administrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.70,0:03:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, the situation has changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.05,0:03:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is sending a hundred soldiers into the city to capture you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.06,0:03:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This... this Zhuge Liang is a devious man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.74,0:03:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.10,0:03:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Zhuge Liang has sent his soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,it means that he trusts Administrator Cui now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.29,0:03:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We can hide axmen in my mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.35,0:03:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,When the Shu soldiers arrive, kill them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.52,0:03:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, lure Zhuge Liang into the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.34,0:03:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I will prepare right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.96,0:03:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Men!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.57,0:04:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Cui Liang, the Administrator of Anding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.62,0:04:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have led my troops to relieve the siege of Nan'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.70,0:04:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower the drawbridge quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.34,0:04:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Open the city gate, lower the drawbridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.15,0:04:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the city gate, lower the drawbridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.46,0:04:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator Cui, please enter the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.56,0:04:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.07,0:04:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yang Ling, stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture Xiahou Mao alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.20,0:05:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.11,0:05:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor cleverly took two cities and captured Xiahou Mao alive. Truly divine strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.54,0:05:22.07,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(994,468)}Zhào Yún\NStyled: Zǐlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.35,0:05:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It is too kind of you, Elder General. I had intended to take Anding and Tianshui first,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.03,0:05:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but, unexpectedly, Cui Liang feigned surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.45,0:05:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,so I just adapted to the situation \Nand used their plan against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.23,0:05:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator, please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:39.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(994,458)}Jiāng Wéi\NStyled: Bóyuē
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.03,0:05:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator, where are you leading your troops?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.34,0:05:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Xiahou is trapped in Nan'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.66,0:05:44.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(314,570)}Mǎ Zūn
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.64,0:05:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shu army has besieged the city for days, it's urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.34,0:05:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Xiahou sent General Pei to break through the siege and request reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.48,0:05:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Anding troops have already gone to assist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.57,0:05:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Our commandery must also urgently assist, hence I lead the army there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.38,0:05:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator, you have fallen into Zhuge Liang's trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.22,0:06:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Boyue, why do you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.22,0:06:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you, the Administrator, sent anyone to verify Anding's troops?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.23,0:06:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I only listened to what General Pei said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Xiahou is trapped in Nan'an without a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.20,0:06:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How could anyone break through the siege to seek help?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.37,0:06:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Moreover, Pei Xu is a nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.71,0:06:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he break through alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.06,0:06:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator, fellow generals!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.17,0:06:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who has ever seen this General Pei?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.18,0:06:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Bold scoundrel! Commander Xiahou is in grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.95,0:06:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You speak nonsense, doubting everything
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.46,0:06:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,, and obstructing the rescue. What is your crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.99,0:06:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Clearly a Shu spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.88,0:06:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Dismount and surrender now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.42,0:06:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I will kill you, scoundrel, on behalf of the Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.81,0:07:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,With your skills, how could you break through the siege?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.72,0:07:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Clearly a Shu spy, here to deceive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.02,0:07:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Behead him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If Boyue had not come today, our army would have fallen for the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.20,0:07:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang tricked the Administrator into leaving the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.31,0:07:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have set an ambush halfway to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.58,0:07:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,With a hidden force on the left, they would seize the opportunity to take the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.54,0:07:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nan'an is in danger, how do we rescue it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.82,0:07:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator, don't worry. I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We can certainly capture Zhuge Liang and save Nan'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Please share the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.43,0:07:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I will lead three thousand elite soldiers to ambush the main road.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.62,0:07:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You lead the troops out of the city. \NThe Shu soldiers will enter in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.87,0:07:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You need not go far, just thirty {\i1}li,{\i0} and then return.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.62,0:08:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch for the signal fire, then attack from front and back to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.85,0:08:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If Zhuge Liang comes personally, he will surely be captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.94,0:08:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldiers on the walls, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.77,0:08:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Administrator has fallen for our Chancellor's strategy to lure him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.81,0:08:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I now lead troops to take Tianshui.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.44,0:08:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender the city now and you will be spared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.25,0:08:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhao Yun, you have fallen for our Jiang Boyue's plan, and you don't even know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.90,0:09:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General, do you know of \NJiang Boyue of Tianshui?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:09:59.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,I did not expect such a person here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.01,0:10:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhao!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.38,0:10:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhao, the Chancellor sent me to support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.02,0:10:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General, please get up quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.30,0:10:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This was my fault, it has nothing to do with you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.10,0:10:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.74,0:10:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could have seen through my plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.80,0:10:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I came out of the mountain, \NI have never met such an opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.10,0:10:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, this man is young yet highly skilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, he is named Jiang Wei, styled Boyue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.10,0:11:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He is from Ji County, Tianshui. \NHe lost his father at a young age,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.89,0:11:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and his mother raised him, \N so he now takes great care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This man is skilled in both civil and military matters, wise and brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.71,0:11:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A hero of our time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.10,0:11:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That Jiang Wei's skill of spears is excellent, not like any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.10,0:11:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Tianshui would be easy to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.10,0:11:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to meet such a strong opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.38,0:11:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhao Yun's defeat will make Zhuge Liang attack personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.07,0:11:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I have ordered the soldiers to prepare more arrows, strengthen the city defenses, and guard all gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.06,0:11:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This way we can keep the city, but we cannot defeat Zhuge Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.50,0:11:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Boyue, do you still want to defeat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.84,0:11:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.87,0:11:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang thinks we will \Nkeep defending the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We can divide our troops into four groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.42,0:11:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I will lay an ambush in the east of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.80,0:12:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We strike when the Shu army arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.94,0:12:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir may lead with Liang Qian and Yin Shang to lay another ambush outside the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.95,0:12:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Liang Xu will lead the civilians to defend on the city walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.11,0:12:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}When besieging a city,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.05,0:12:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}the armies must be drummed up upon arrival and charge as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.11,0:12:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Should they tarry, their spirit would be lost.\NThen, the city would be hard to take!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.42,0:12:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Lay siege to this city. \NLaunch the assault tomorrow morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.70,0:13:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:13.65,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(953,433)}Guān Xīng\NStyled: Ānguó
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.02,0:13:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Wei soldiers are attacking our camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.36,0:13:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they from the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.66,0:13:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We have not seen troops come out of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.70,0:13:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please retreat quickly, Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.62,0:13:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I have fallen into Jiang Wei's trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.38,0:13:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, light the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.86,0:13:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, light the fire, burn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.73,0:14:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.10,0:14:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory does not depend on numbers, but on the command.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.21,0:14:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei is truly a talented commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.21,0:14:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pity that he is not in our army.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.38,0:14:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.86,0:14:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.80,0:14:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, why not rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.24,0:14:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General, do you know my thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.01,0:14:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you don't wish to recruit Jiang Wei?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.82,0:14:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I came out of the thatched cottage, I have been seeking great talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.03,0:15:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I see Jiang Wei's strategic and combat skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.50,0:15:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish to recruit him as my aide.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.50,0:15:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If Jiang Wei were to surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.25,0:15:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,he would surely achieve great things, under the Chancellor's guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.95,0:15:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,To support the Han Dynasty, we had the Five Tiger Generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.49,0:15:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now only you, Elder General, remain, with white hair like frost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.96,0:15:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I am over fifty as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.50,0:15:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We need new talents, as pillars to continue our task to support and preserve the Han Dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.25,0:15:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei is young, \Nyet wise and valiant. A true hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:15:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Jiang Wei's mother now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.85,0:15:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She lives in Ji County.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ji County...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.10,0:16:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.78,0:16:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang has divided his troops into three paths, one to siege Tianshui,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.34,0:16:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,one path directly towards Shanggui, and one attacking Ji County.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.18,0:16:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Attacking Ji County? How many troops?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.14,0:16:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-Nearly five thousand.\N-Who leads them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Major General Wei Yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wave the flag, beat the drums, and attack the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.84,0:16:45.69,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(984,493)}Wèi Yán\NStyled: Wéncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.04,0:16:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator, Administrator, Wei Yan of Shu is attacking Ji County!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.98,0:16:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My old mother is in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.78,0:17:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If captured by the Shu army, she will surely suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.55,0:17:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you, sir, to allocate five thousand troops to rescue the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.22,0:17:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.58,0:17:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator, if my mother is lost, I cannot live another day! Administrator!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.62,0:17:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly get up, General, why do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.62,0:17:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I will give you three thousand troops to rescue Ji County quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Jiang Wei, will never forget \Nthe Administrator's kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.06,0:17:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wei Yan, cease being arrogant, Jiang Boyue is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.02,0:18:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to chase, hurry into the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower the drawbridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.91,0:18:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. General, you have tricked Jiang Wei into the city. You deserve the highest credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.66,0:18:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.66,0:18:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Has Xiahou Mao been brought from Nan'an?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He is waiting outside the tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.66,0:18:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Bring him in.\N-Yes, sir. Bring in Xiahou Mao.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.01,0:19:10.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It is said that you, Prince Consort Xiahou, in order to avenge your father, Xiahou Yuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.70,0:19:12.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,requested for soldiers to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.08,0:19:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,When you left the palace, you had made a vow to all the courtiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.85,0:19:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you could not capture Zhuge Liang alive, you would not return to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.66,0:19:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, spare me. Chancellor, spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.63,0:19:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,As the Grand Commander, how can you behave like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.57,0:19:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to live, there is something you must do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.41,0:19:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I will do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.87,0:19:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei of Tianshui is currently guarding Ji County.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.86,0:19:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I have surrounded the city completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.37,0:19:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei, seeing the city isolated, has sent a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.86,0:19:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,In the letter, he said: if the Prince Consort is there, he is willing to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.13,0:20:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I spare your life today. Will you persuade Jiang Wei to surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.02,0:20:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I will go to Ji County in person and make Jiang Wei surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.90,0:20:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It is rare for you to be so straightforward. Good, no time to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.90,0:20:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Please go immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.75,0:20:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, sir.\N-Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.75,0:20:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I will escort him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.95,0:20:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Consort Xiahou has agreed. Why worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.14,0:20:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Please go alone, there will be no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.13,0:20:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.38,0:20:36.39,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(334,582)}Zhāng Bāo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.73,0:20:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No need for accompaniment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.30,0:20:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare horses, and send Commander Xiahou out of the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.37,0:20:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.47,0:20:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.41,0:20:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It is my duty, it is my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.98,0:20:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.19,0:21:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.12,0:21:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It is him! it is him, Xiahou Mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.43,0:21:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.54,0:21:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you panicking?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.27,0:21:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,General, we are all civilians from Ji County.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.86,0:21:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei has surrendered the city and joined Zhuge Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.15,0:21:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,General of Shu, Wei Yan, is burning and looting in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.65,0:21:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We had to abandon our homes and flee.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.46,0:21:37.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We want to take refuge in Shanggui. Oh, run now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.39,0:21:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei has surrendered to the Shu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.46,0:21:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the Tianshui Commandery seat? Where is it? Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.71,0:21:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Not far ahead on this road.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.14,0:22:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, well done! You deserve a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.14,0:22:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chancellor. Thank you, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.46,0:22:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, please have some tea. Please have some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.58,0:22:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That fool Zhuge Liang sent me to persuade Jiang Wei to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.75,0:22:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I took the opportunity to escape alone with one horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.96,0:22:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, your wisdom and bravery are admirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.63,0:22:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Jiang Wei has surrendered Ji County, he has joined the Shu army.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.80,0:22:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang will attack Tianshui with full force.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.64,0:23:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-The Administrator must be on guard.\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.78,0:23:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But Jiang Wei's surrender \Nto Shu is not very credible.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.58,0:23:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked the civilians of Ji County personally, how can it be wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.82,0:23:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.06,0:23:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Twice the strategy has succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.60,0:23:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, send a fake Jiang Wei over,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.06,0:23:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and great things are in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.06,0:23:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pity to let Xiahou Mao go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.06,0:23:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Letting Xiahou Mao go is like releasing a duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.70,0:23:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If we capture Jiang Boyue, we capture a phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.02,0:23:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei has surrendered to our Chancellor. Surrender the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.86,0:23:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender the city, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.99,0:23:51.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I told you of his surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.42,0:23:54.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What's happening now? Is Jiang Wei not leading troops here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.86,0:23:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He has indeed surrendered to Shu!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.31,0:24:11.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,General! General!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.67,0:24:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Shu army is attacking Tianshui. The situation is critical!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.08,0:24:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Go scout again.\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.63,0:24:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-General!\N-What's the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.11,0:24:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,General, look, the Shu army is transporting grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.98,0:24:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The city is short of grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.51,0:24:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not go intercept it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.22,0:24:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Order the troops to rush out of the city.\N-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.20,0:25:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wei army is coming. Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.34,0:25:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.70,0:25:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, return to the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.72,0:25:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.90,0:25:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Bold Jiang Wei, how dare you come to steal the grain? Prepare to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.26,0:25:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.06,0:26:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower the drawbridge. Open the gate now!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.30,0:26:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei, you took the grain, \Nand I took the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.08,0:26:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You have fallen for my Chancellor's plan. Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.74,0:26:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.58,0:27:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge! Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.57,0:27:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei, where will you go now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.34,0:27:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, open the gate, I am Jiang Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.97,0:27:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.74,0:27:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebel, you still dare to trick me into opening the gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.08,0:27:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator, what do you mean by this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.08,0:27:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You know in your heart, and still ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.86,0:27:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator, this...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.58,0:27:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Loose the arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.85,0:28:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Unexpectedly, my great cause is unfinished,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.72,0:28:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and I die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.14,0:28:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My death is not worth pitying,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.90,0:28:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but my mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.63,0:29:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I can no longer serve you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.54,0:29:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in death, I cannot rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.28,0:29:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wei'er! Wei'er! Oh, Wei'er!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.69,0:29:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.90,0:29:31.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(308,530)}Mother \Nof Jiang Wei
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.89,0:29:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.83,0:29:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother! Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.30,0:29:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wei.\N-Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.11,0:29:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you abandoning me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.41,0:29:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I have failed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.90,0:29:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.32,0:29:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Son, you are so foolish!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.34,0:30:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I am now at a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.34,0:30:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeated and driven to this point, I can only commit suicide to avoid humiliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.98,0:30:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not expect Mother to also be captured by the Shu army.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.41,0:30:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It is my fault you suffer disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.62,0:30:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wei'er, Chancellor Zhuge has not harmed \Nthe civilians at all since he entered Ji County.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.43,0:30:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He specially sent people to deliver food and clothing, and has taken good care of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.91,0:30:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor cherishes talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.54,0:30:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He could not bear to kill you, so he brought me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.97,0:30:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and thank the Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.53,0:31:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Jiang Wei, am willing to surrender to the Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.34,0:31:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.34,0:31:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}Since I left the thatched cottage,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.30,0:31:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}I searched for able men everywhere to pass on my life's studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.54,0:31:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Today, I have found you, Boyue, and my wish is fulfilled!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.12,0:31:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.74,0:31:53.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,After Zhuge Liang accepted Jiang Wei,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.82,0:31:56.00,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei offered a counter-plot,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.00,0:32:00.89,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,helping Zhuge Liang conquer Tianshui and Shanggui.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.89,0:32:06.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,The Shu-Han army's reputation soared, and cities surrendered without a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.06,0:32:09.36,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang's army advanced to Mount Qi,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.36,0:32:13.06,Thinking,,0,0,0,,camping by the Wei River and closing in on Chang'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.73,0:32:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we can set up camp here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.13,0:32:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, give the order to set up camp here!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.62,0:33:03.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang has sent us a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.34,0:33:06.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(505,345)}Cáo Zhēn\NStyled: Zǐdān
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.06,0:33:09.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(324,468)}Guō Huái\NStyled: Bójì
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.74,0:33:13.85,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(980,452)}Wáng Lǎng\NStyled: Jǐngxīng
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.58,0:33:07.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He requests a battle tomorrow. How should we respond?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.92,0:33:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, Zhuge Liang has taken several of our cities, and his soldiers are at their peak.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.96,0:33:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A battle tomorrow will be perfect to break their spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.67,0:33:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, you should organize the troops, \Ndisplay the banners, and bolster our morale.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.34,0:33:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, at the front of the two armies, I will only need to say a few words.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.90,0:33:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you that Zhuge Liang will surrender, and the Shu army will retreat without a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.19,0:33:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of person is Zhuge Liang?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.78,0:33:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How can he retreat just by a few words at the front?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.66,0:33:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If you, General Guo, do not believe me, you can watch from the front tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.77,0:34:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, you will see it for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.45,0:34:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the approaching man Zhuge Kongming?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.98,0:34:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.45,0:35:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}I have long heard your great reputation, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.82,0:35:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}and now I am fortunate to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.80,0:35:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Since you, sir, know of Heaven's Mandate and understand current affairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.02,0:35:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}why do you raise such unjust \Nforce to violate our borders?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.57,0:35:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}I punish the traitors by edict. How is it unjust?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.40,0:35:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Heaven's ordination has changed, the divine instruments have changed hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.68,0:35:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}That they belong to virtuous \Nmen is a reason of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.81,0:35:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}The traitor Cao usurped the Han and occupies the Central Plains with impunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.55,0:35:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}How are they virtuous men?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.80,0:35:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}Since the reigns of Emperors Huan and Ling,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.60,0:35:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}the Yellow Turbans ran rampant and the realm fell into chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.42,0:35:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}The state was in grave danger, \Nand lives were upended.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.86,0:36:07.31,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Taizu (太祖), a temple name meaning "Great Ancestor." Wu (武), a posthumous name meaning "Martial."\NBoth were given to Cao Cao after the establishment of Cao Wei, posthumously making him an emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.88,0:36:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}Our Taizu Emperor Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.14,0:36:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}cleared the Six Rivers \Nand swept the world clean,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.54,0:36:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}thus gained the allegiance of millions and won the respect of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.42,0:36:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}This is not obtained through power and influence,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.74,0:36:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}but through his Mandate of Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.48,0:36:21.74,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Shizu (世祖), a temple name meaning "Eternal Ancestor." Wen (文), a posthumous name meaning "Civil."\NBoth were given to Cao Pi after his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.48,0:36:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}Our Shizu Emperor Wen,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.04,0:36:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}divine in civil matters and holy in military arts, \Nhaving undertaken the great succession,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.94,0:36:28.30,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Yao and Shun were mythical rulers of Ancient China.\N The former abdicated to the latter, which is claimed as precedent.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.58,0:36:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}followed the example of Yao's yielding to Shun in accordance to Heaven and men,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.07,0:36:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}and reigned over all nations from the Middle Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.74,0:36:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}How is this not following Heaven's intent and men's will?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.86,0:36:42.34,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Guan Zhong (管仲): Chancellor of the State of Qi during the Spring and Autumn Period.\NYue Yi (乐毅): General of the State of Yan during the Warring States Period.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.30,0:36:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Today, you, sir, possess great ability and lofty ambition,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.86,0:36:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}comparing yourself \Nto Guan Zhong and Yue Yi.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.74,0:36:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Why are you fighting against principles of Heaven and the will of men?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.02,0:36:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}Are you unaware of ancient teachings?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.08,0:36:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Those who conform with Heaven prosper and those who oppose it fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.82,0:36:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Now, our Great Wei bring a million men and a thousand great generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.02,0:36:59.10,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: It was thought that fireflies come from decaying grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.02,0:36:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}How can the flicker of your decaying grass
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.10,0:37:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}compare against the brightness of the Moon in the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.96,0:37:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Should you lay down your arms \Nand submit in courtesy and ceremony,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.80,0:37:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}you could still be named a noble of your own fief.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.34,0:37:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}A peaceful land and merry folk, is this not fulfillment enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.88,0:37:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}I thought that you, an elder statesman of the Han dynasty,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.02,0:37:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}amidst our two armies, \Nwould uphold greater reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.65,0:37:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Who would think you could utter such drivel as these words!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.45,0:37:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}I have my own words to say. \NPlease hear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.25,0:37:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}During the times of Emperors Huan and Ling,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.51,0:37:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}the Han Empire fell to disorder, \Nand the eunuchs fomented disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.80,0:37:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Years of chaos, turmoil plagued across four directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.00,0:37:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}After the Yellow Turbans,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.71,0:37:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}the likes of Dong Zhuo, Li Jue, and Guo Si, in succession,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.91,0:37:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}took the Emperor of Han as hostage and plundered the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.08,0:38:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Thenceforth, in the Imperial Palace, rotten wood served as support,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.02,0:38:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}and in the court, wild beasts employed to serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.22,0:38:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Those with hearts of wolves and acts of dogs managed the realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.34,0:38:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}while the servile and the cajoling held onto office.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.14,0:38:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}Thus, the spirits of the realm became ruin,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.94,0:38:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}and the common people suffered in misery!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.08,0:38:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}In this time of crisis...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.91,0:38:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}What have you, Minister Wang, done?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.14,0:38:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}Regarding Minister Wang's life,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.48,0:38:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}I have long known of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.34,0:38:45.98,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Xiaolian (孝廉): Part of early Imperial Examination, where each commandery regularly nominating someone for civil offices. Literally means "filial and incorrupt."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.34,0:38:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}You dwelled on the coast of the East Sea,\N nominated into office in {\i1}xiaolian.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.45,0:38:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}thus the duty to rectify your lord, aid your nation, and assist the Imperial House!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.91,0:38:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13} Yet, you collude with the treacherous and plot of usurpation!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.88,0:38:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}Sins unforgivable by Heaven and Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.80,0:38:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}You...! Peasant Zhuge...!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.85,0:38:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}You dare-!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.68,0:38:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.80,0:39:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}Shameless senile,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.20,0:39:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}are you ignorant of men who wish \Nnothing less than to chew your flesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.80,0:39:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}You dare blather still?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.80,0:39:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Yet Heaven has not forsaken \Nthe Dynasty of Fire-signed Han,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.91,0:39:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}it was in the Riverlands that our Emperor Zhaolie undertook the great succession.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.06,0:39:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}I bear his heir's edict today\Nto punish the traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.25,0:39:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}You, a groveler of a vassal,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.28,0:39:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}can only turn tail to save your own hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.14,0:39:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}How dare you speak of Heaven's ordinance?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.60,0:39:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}White-haired coward! Grey-beard wretch!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.31,0:39:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}You are but one step from the Nine Springs,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.31,0:39:33.66,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Nine Springs ((九泉) = the underworld
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.66,0:39:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}with what do you face \Nthe twenty-four generations of Han?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.25,0:39:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.60,0:39:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}Treacherous bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.54,0:39:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}You lived your seventy-six years in vain!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.62,0:39:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}You made no merit, yet still run your mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.17,0:39:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}{\pos(640,662)}and aid the Cao to your debasement!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.00,0:39:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}A dog with broken backbone,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.91,0:39:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.65,0:39:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,662)}{\bord13}dares to bark and snarl before our army!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.28,0:39:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.77,0:40:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Never have I seen more shameless, inept man such as you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.65,0:40:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You...!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.42,0:40:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Minister Wang!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.17,0:40:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Minister Wang!
Comment: 0,0:39:09.80,0:39:15.60,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,"Fire-signed Han": Under the concept that the virtues (德) of Earth, Metal, Water, Wood, and Fire successively replace each other, dynasties were assigned one of these virtues in order.

